# C# Async Method Names

- Do not add an `Async` suffix to async method names.
- Prefer names that describe the operation, regardless of whether the implementation uses `async`/`await`.
- When adding or renaming async methods, use names like `Initialize`, `GetById`, `Add`, `Update`, and `Delete` instead of `InitializeAsync`, `GetByIdAsync`, `AddAsync`, `UpdateAsync`, and `DeleteAsync`.
